  "typed_layout_note": "Unmodified official public-domain LZMA SDK16.04 decoder compiled as C linkage C++ with original static MY_FAST_CALL/noinline declarations. All17 complete code functions and all internal relative calls resolved by unique full functions and source call graph; no externals/data/EH. Ten public roots close seven private helpers without exporting storage3 statics. Actual uint16 probabilities, uint32/size_t32 and112-byte CLzmaDec remain original. Allocator callbacks use real ISzAlloc8 (Alloc,Free); allocated probability/dictionary extents and streaming status/error boundary behavior unchanged. No copied instruction bytes, symbolic assembly or fake dependency. Full linked owner/ABI/negative controls remain required."
}
